  "name": "Exorcism",
  "type": "spell",
  "img": "icons/svg/daze.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You call upon holy forces to harm unholy creatures. Make a ranged spell attack against a creature in range, and on a hit, they take 3d8 radiant damage. Additionally, if that creature is an aberration, fiend, or undead, they take 2d8 additional radiant damage.</p><p>If the target is possessed or charmed by an aberration, fiend, or undead, only the possessing or charming creature takes the damage if they are in range of the spell, and the target can reroll against possession or charmed effect with advantage.</p><p><strong>At Higher Levels.</strong> When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, you deal an additional 1d8 radiant damage, for each slot level above 2nd.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
